6/26, his definition of an oops reversal: (1) opens below the previous close, (2) makes a low below the previous day's low, (3) reclaims the previous low, (4) goes red to green over the previous close, (5) reclaims 50% of the previous day's candle, (6) breaks the previous day's high (engulf). Steps 5 and 6 don't always happen the same day.

